---
title: "Zanzibar Airport Transfers"
description: "Private Zanzibar airport transfers from ZNZ to Stone Town, Nungwi, Kendwa, Paje and all zones, with fixed prices and flight tracking."
permalink: "/transfers/index.html"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="content">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Airport Transfers</h1>
    <p>Private, reliable transfers from Abeid Amani Karume International Airport (ZNZ) to any zone in Zanzibar. Fixed pricing, flight tracking, meet & greet included.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Airport Transfers</span>
        <h2>Private Transfers to Every Zone</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Fixed pricing, flight tracking, meet & greet included. Up to 4 passengers with luggage per vehicle.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid transfer-grid">
        {% for transfer in transfers %}
          <article class="card transfer-card reveal" data-category="TRF">
            <div class="card-image" style="position:relative;">
              {% set trImg = ["white-van-zanzibar-tourism.jpg","zanzibar-tourist-van-rental.jpg","private-hire-van-zanzibar.jpg"][loop.index0 % 3] %}
              <img src="/images/{{ trImg }}" alt="{{ transfer.title }} — private transfer vehicle, Zanzibar" loading="lazy">
              <span class="card-badge badge-transfer" style="position: absolute; top: 1rem; left: 1rem; right: auto;">Transfer</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <h3 class="card-title">{{ transfer.title }}</h3>
              <p class="card-meta">{{ transfer.route }} • {{ transfer.duration }}</p>
              <div class="transfer-includes" style="margin-top: 1rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--dct-gray-light);">
                <h4 style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--dct-ocean); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Includes:</h4>
                <ul style="list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 0.4rem;">
                  {% for item in transfer.includes %}
                  <li style="position: relative; padding-left: 1.25rem; color: var(--dct-text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem;">{% if loop.index0 == 0 %}✓{% else %}✓{% endif %} {{ item }}</li>
                  {% endfor %}
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="card-price">{{ transfer.price.display }}</span>
                <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=I'd%20like%20to%20book%20{{ transfer.title | urlize }}%20transfer" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Book via WhatsApp</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Service Details</span>
        <h2>What's Included</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="safari-includes" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <div class="safari-include-item reveal">
          <div style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--dct-ocean-light); color: var(--dct-ocean); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 auto 1rem;">✈️</div>
          <h4>Meet & Greet</h4>
          <p>Name board at arrivals hall — we track your flight so you're never waiting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="safari-include-item reveal">
          <div style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--dct-palm-light); color: var(--dct-palm); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 auto 1rem;">⏱️</div>
          <h4>60 Min Free Wait</h4>
          <p>No extra charge for flight delays — first hour of waiting is free.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="safari-include-item reveal">
          <div style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--dct-spice-light); color: var(--dct-spice-dark); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 auto 1rem;">👶</div>
          <h4>Child Seats</h4>
          <p>Available on request with advance notice — safety first for families.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="safari-include-item reveal">
          <div style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 14px; background: #fef3e2; color: var(--dct-coral); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 auto 1rem;">🚐</div>
          <h4>Large Groups</h4>
          <p>Minivan and coach rates available for 5+ passengers — just ask us.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="safari-include-item reveal">
          <div style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--dct-ocean-light); color: var(--dct-ocean); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 auto 1rem;">🔄</div>
          <h4>Return Transfers</h4>
          <p>Same rate for return — book round-trip and save the hassle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="safari-include-item reveal">
          <div style="width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--dct-palm-light); color: var(--dct-palm); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 auto 1rem;">💬</div>
          <h4>WhatsApp Support</h4>
          <p>Message us on landing — your driver will coordinate directly via WhatsApp.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Zones Covered</span>
        <h2>All Zones We Cover</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">From Stone Town to the farthest beaches — we cover every zone in Zanzibar.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="area-quick-picks" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="/images/stone-town-beach-boats-and-buildings.jpg" alt="Stone Town seafront — beach boats and historic buildings" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Stone Town</h3>
            <p>Historic centre — 15 min from airport</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="/images/zanzibar-kendwa-beach-aerial-dhow-kayak.jpg" alt="Nungwi/Kendwa north coast beach, Zanzibar" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Nungwi / Kendwa</h3>
            <p>North coast — 65–70 min from airport</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="/images/paje-beach-zanzibar-kitesurfing-indian-ocean.jpg" alt="Paje/Jambiani southeast coast, Zanzibar" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Paje / Jambiani</h3>
            <p>Southeast coast — 50–55 min from airport</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="/images/zanzibar-island-resort-pier-boats.jpg" alt="Kiwengwa/Pongwe — island resort pier and boats, Zanzibar" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Kiwengwa / Pongwe</h3>
            <p>Northeast coast — 45–50 min from airport</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="/.netlify/images?url=/images/zanzibar-jambiani-beach-low-tide-local-children.jpg&fm=webp&q=85" alt="Bwejuu/Dongwe southeast luxury coast, Zanzibar" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Bwejuu / Dongwe</h3>
            <p>Southeast luxury — 55–60 min from airport</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="quick-pick reveal">
          <div class="quick-pick-image">
            <img src="/images/the-rock-restaurant-michamvi-pingwe-zanzibar.jpg" alt="Michamvi/Pingwe — The Rock Restaurant east coast, Zanzibar" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="quick-pick-content">
            <h3>Michamvi / Pingwe</h3>
            <p>East coast / The Rock — 50 min from airport</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--dct-text-muted);" class="reveal">Not sure of your zone? <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp us</a> with your hotel name and we'll confirm the rate.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-content reveal">
      <h2>Ready to Book Your Transfer?</h2>
      <p>Message us on WhatsApp with your flight details, hotel name, and number of passengers. We'll confirm the fixed price instantly.</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=I'd%20like%20to%20book%20an%20airport%20transfer%20in%20Zanzibar" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Book Transfer on WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
